# 🚗 AutoStock – Car Dealership Inventory System

A full-stack **Car Dealership Inventory Management System** developed as part of the TDD Kata. The application allows users to browse and purchase vehicles, while administrators can manage vehicles, inventory, users, purchases, and restocking operations through a dedicated dashboard.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

AutoStock is a web-based vehicle inventory management application designed to simplify dealership inventory operations.

The system provides:

* User registration and login
* JWT-based authentication
* Role-based authorization
* Vehicle inventory management
* Vehicle search and filtering
* Vehicle purchasing
* Vehicle restocking
* Admin vehicle management
* User management
* Purchase history
* Inventory reports
* Admin dashboard
* Responsive React-based user interface

---

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

### Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB
* Mongoose
* JSON Web Token (JWT)
* bcrypt
* REST API

### Frontend

* React
* Vite
* JavaScript
* HTML5
* CSS3

### Development Tools

* Git
* GitHub
* Visual Studio Code
* MongoDB
* MongoDB Compass
* ChatGPT

