# 🤖 My AI Usage

## AI Tool Used

**ChatGPT (OpenAI)**

ChatGPT was used as an AI-assisted development tool during the implementation of the AutoStock – Car Dealership Inventory System.

## How ChatGPT Was Used

ChatGPT was used for:

* Understanding the TDD Kata requirements.
* Planning the project structure.
* Developing and debugging the Node.js and Express.js backend.
* Implementing REST API functionality.
* Working with MongoDB and Mongoose.
* Implementing JWT authentication and authorization.
* Implementing vehicle inventory operations.
* Developing the React frontend.
* Connecting frontend components with backend APIs.
* Designing and refining the Admin Dashboard UI.
* Debugging React, API, and integration issues.
* Troubleshooting Git and GitHub issues.
* Preparing project documentation and deployment guidance.

## Reflection

ChatGPT helped accelerate development by providing technical explanations, debugging assistance, implementation guidance, and UI improvement suggestions.

The suggestions were reviewed and adapted according to the project's requirements and existing codebase. The AI was used as a development assistant while building and testing the application.

