# 🎯 Project Objective

The objective of AutoStock is to provide a practical full-stack inventory management solution for a car dealership while demonstrating skills in:

* REST API development
* Database management
* Authentication
* Authorization
* React SPA development
* Inventory management
* Git version control
* AI-assisted development
* Software testing
* Responsive UI design

